  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Echo. For 10...30...35 seconds, whenever a chant or shout ends on target non-spirit ally, all foes adjacent to that ally are set on Fire for 1...6...7 second[s].",
      "zhTW": "持續 10～35 秒，每當「戰嚎」或「聖歌」的效果在「非靈」的目標盟友身上結束時，所有鄰近該盟友的敵人將遭受「著火」病症 1～7 秒。"
    },
    "pvp": {
      "en": "Echo. For 10...30...35 seconds, whenever a chant or shout ends on target non-spirit ally, all foes adjacent to that ally are set on Fire for 1...4...5 second[s].",
